Package: FlowSorted.Blood.450k
Version: 1.51.2
Title: Illumina HumanMethylation Data on Sorted Blood Cell Populations
Description: Provides functions to download (and cache locally via
	BiocFileCache) data objects for the Illumina 450k DNA methylation
	microarrays, and an object depicting which CpGs on the array are
	associated with cell type. The underlying data is hosted on Zenodo.
Authors@R: person(given = c("Andrew", "E"),
                   family = "Jaffe",
                   role = c("aut", "cre"),
                   email = "andrewejaffe@gmail.com")
License: Artistic-2.0
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0), minfi (>= 1.21.2)
Imports: BiocFileCache, tools
LazyData: yes
biocViews: ExperimentData, Homo_sapiens_Data, Tissue, MicroarrayData, TissueMicroarrayData, MethylationArrayData

